---
description: Check context availability when a visitor skips an earlier exhibition zone.
args: { dossier: ExhibitionDossier; change: ExhibitionChange; arguments: NarrativeSupport[] }
returns: string[]
---
For every optional route, identify later claims whose context is introduced only in a skipped zone. Require a supported contextual cue in the later label or mark that route's interpretation incomplete. Keep accessible route tests and evidence attached to the affected zones.
